						<a href="https://koolykh88.fireflyaff.com/#/?code=vKGtXoK4" target="_blank" rel="nofollow sponsored" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-rose-600 px-8 py-3.5 text-base font-bold text-white shadow-lg shadow-rose-500/30 hover:bg-rose-500 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5">
